# Smoked Salmon Sushi Bowl

Based on [https://themodernproper.com/salmon-sushi-bowl](https://themodernproper.com/salmon-sushi-bowl) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250801063948/https://themodernproper.com/salmon-sushi-bowl))

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] [Smoked salmon]{ ing="smoked-salmon" }, sliced
- [ ] [Sushi rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" }
- [ ] [Cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }, diced or julienned
- [ ] [Avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, sliced
- [ ] [Edamame]{ ing="edamame" }, shelled
- [ ] [Carrots]{ ing="carrots" }, julienned or shredded
- [ ] [Seaweed salad]{ ing="seaweed-salad" } (optional)
- [ ] [Pickled ginger]{ ing="pickled-ginger" }
- [ ] [Sesame seeds]{ ing="sesame-seeds" }
- [ ] [Nori sheets]{ ing="nori-sheets" }, cut into strips
- [ ] [Soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" }
- [ ] [Sriracha or spicy mayo]{ ing="sriracha-or-spicy-mayo" } (optional)
- [ ] [Rice vinegar]{ ing="rice-vinegar" }

### Seasoning

- [ ] 2 Tbsp [rice vinegar]{ ing="rice-vinegar" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [sugar]{ ing="sugar" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }

## Recipe

1. Prepare [sushi rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" } according to package directions
1. While rice is cooking, prepare the seasoning by mixing [rice vinegar]{ ing="rice-vinegar" }, [sugar]{ ing="sugar" }, and [salt]{ ing="salt" }
1. Once rice is cooked, fold in the seasoning mixture and let cool
1. Arrange cooled rice in bowls
1. Top with [smoked salmon]{ ing="smoked-salmon" }, [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }, [avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, [edamame]{ ing="edamame" }, and [carrots]{ ing="carrots" }
1. Add [seaweed salad]{ ing="seaweed-salad" }, [pickled ginger]{ ing="pickled-ginger" }, and nori strips
1. Sprinkle with [sesame seeds]{ ing="sesame-seeds" }
1. Serve with [soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } and optional [sriracha or spicy mayo]{ ing="sriracha-or-spicy-mayo" }

## Notes

1. This modern deconstructed approach is flexible and easy to customize
1. Use whatever vegetables you have on hand - radishes, corn, or greens work well
1. The smoked salmon provides rich, smoky flavor throughout the bowl
1. Great for meal prep - keep components separate and assemble when ready to eat
1. Can add a soft-boiled egg or extra protein if desired
